          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "babaGate",
          "text": "ID card. ...Scholar? (He looks at your box, then at you, and his voice gets kinder.) Welcome, my son. Walk on the left. The cars on the right don't brake for scholars."
        },
        {
          "type": "goto",
          "scene": "hostel"
        }
